Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 026] panvk/csf: flush the FAU stores before indirect draws read them

Purpose: flush FAU stores before indirect draws read them (upstream CSF fix)
Source/Reference: upstream Mesa commit fbb4993c5d7 (author preserved)
Backport-of: fbb4993c5d7
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (0xb8a31030, PAN_ARCH 11)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b3e50d8c7c7794f97a2df1742613b
Dependencies: csf-v11/025
Validation test: tests/dxvk/vulkan device matrix (dx5 IDVS+gpu_prerast 13/13, clip-cull 13/13, multi-viewport 5/5, fill-mode 17/17)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
index 49216422420ff8009f06248e62c58ec25ace01dd..07bad5f29eb78f1b3f06123537220440c07bd300 100644
